          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{service=\"member-eligibility\",route=~\"/api/.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) / sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{service=\"member-eligibility\",route=~\"/api/.*\"}[1m]))",
